@1 = ~Corrosive Spit~
@2 = ~Corrosive Spit
(Conjuration)

Level: 2
Range: Short (half that of Melf's Acid Arrow)
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell partial

The Black Dragon Disciple spits a gob of corrosive acid at a nearby creature, dealing 5d4 acid damage. A creature that fails a save vs. Spell is blinded by the acid for 1 round and suffers another 5d4 acid damage at the start of the next round.~

// Combat log
@3 = ~Blinded by the corrosive spit~
